OL,3,GNEWSADiwali: Sweets, lights and
OL,4,Acelebrations at Neasden Temple
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than half a million people living
OL,7,Fin London will be celebrating Diwali
OL,8,Fand the Hindu new year in the next few
OL,9,Fdays.
OL,11,FBBC London visited Neasden Temple - the
OL,12,Flargest Hindu temple in the capital -
OL,13,Fas celebrations got under way this
OL,14,Fweekend.
OL,16,FPrayers were offered, music was played
OL,17,Fand a fireworks display rounded out
OL,18,FSunday at the temple also known as BAPS
OL,19,FShri Swaminarayan Mandir in Brent,
OL,20,Fnorth-west London.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
