OL,3,GNEWSADiwali: Sweets, lights and
OL,4,Acelebrations at Neasden Temple
OL,5,
OL,6,FKnown as the festival of lights, Diwali
OL,7,Fis a celebration of the spiritual
OL,8,Ftriumph of light over darkness, and
OL,9,Fgood over evil. It lasts for five days
OL,10,Fand is observed by Hindus, Sikhs and
OL,11,FJains.
